      },
      {
        "id": "existing look and neutral",
        "verdict": "PROVISIONALLY_USEFUL_REUSE",
        "reason": "Retained identity and readable attention/neutral posture. No new look or neutral drawing/gain is claimed."
      }
    ],
    "normalSizeFinding": "Actual64CSS/density1 raw and codec, light/dark. Broad identity, body scale and feet remain coherent without conspicuous body jump, deep crouch or long-leg reach. Mild contour/toe detail shimmer is secondary, not the held reason. Own live blink60/3/27@30Hz observes60/61/62closedphase, exactneutral63 return and89heldthrough3000ms. Existing look60/6/24 also returns to the same neutral. No page errors; images inspected only in memory.",
    "qualifications": "The normal-size recognition criterion remains unchanged; neither genuine native closure, technical/palette success nor matching bounds substitutes for readable closure. No inference of physical pressure/support. Runtime NOT_SUBMITTED/NOT_TESTED for the failed new blink; no automatic retry or reviewer generation. Source originals/all attempts and prior held results remain unchanged.",
